00:17:19,180 --> 00:17:22,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who can obtain Mangekyo Sharingan
just like me...</font>

138
00:17:25,810 --> 00:17:28,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, on one condition.</font>

139
00:17:34,570 --> 00:17:36,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your closest friend...</font>

140
00:17:49,590 --> 00:17:50,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Final Valley...</font>

141
00:17:51,670 --> 00:17:54,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think that Sasuke and Naruto
would battle it out here...</font>

142
00:17:58,680 --> 00:18:00,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How ironic...</font>

143
00:18:03,310 --> 00:18:04,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

144
00:18:07,480 --> 00:18:09,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I look at
the flow of this water</font>

145
00:18:10,020 --> 00:18:16,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's as if I'm being confronted
by an eternal never-ending battle...</font>

146
00:18:20,740 --> 00:18:22,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just like the fate of the two people
depicted in these statues here</font>

147
00:18:23,080 --> 00:18:26,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who founded the Village Hidden
in the Leaves...</font>

148
00:18:30,960 --> 00:18:37,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto and Sasuke,
as long as you both live...</font>

149
00:18:56,230 --> 00:18:58,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have to kill...</font>

150
00:19:01,320 --> 00:19:03,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">your closest friend!</font>

151
00:19:18,090 --> 00:19:19,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not gonna...</font>

152
00:19:20,970 --> 00:19:23,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">abide by everything you say!</font>

153
00:19:31,140 --> 00:19:34,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will get my hands on power
doing it my own way!</font>

154
00:19:36,020 --> 00:19:39,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will surpass you
doing it my own way!</font>

155
00:19:41,030 --> 00:19:42,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Without fail!</font>

156
00:19:56,550 --> 00:19:59,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The rain's... let up, hasn't it?</font>

157
00:20:00,920 --> 00:20:01,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

158
00:20:17,980 --> 00:20:19,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With that much rain</font>

159
00:20:19,820 --> 00:20:21,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't be able to pursue
the scent anymore.</font>

160
00:20:23,240 --> 00:20:26,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto is more important now
than pursuing Sasuke.</font>

161
00:20:28,240 --> 00:20:29,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

162
00:20:53,940 --> 00:20:56,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's gotten interesting, hasn't it?</font>

163
00:20:58,520 --> 00:20:59,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

164
00:21:11,720 --> 00:21:16,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">hitotsu hitotsu omoidaseba</font></font></font></font>

165
00:21:11,720 --> 00:21:16,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">when I recalled the parts one by one,</font></font></font></font>

166
00:21:16,490 --> 00:21:22,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">subete wakatteita kigashite ita no ni</font></font></font></font>

167
00:21:16,490 --> 00:21:22,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">I felt as though I had understood everything</font></font></font></font>

168
00:21:22,890 --> 00:21:27,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">iroaseta kotoba wa</font></font></font></font>

169
00:21:22,890 --> 00:21:27,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">faded words</font></font></font></font>

170
00:21:27,300 --> 00:21:33,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">boku no sugu soba ni oite atta</font></font></font></font>

171
00:21:27,300 --> 00:21:33,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">which I kept so close to me</font></font></font></font>

172
00:21:33,670 --> 00:21:38,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">kotae no denai yoru to</font></font></font></font>

173
00:21:33,670 --> 00:21:38,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">speechless nights,</font></font></font></font>

174
00:21:39,250 --> 00:21:43,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">a hint of warmth,</font></font></font></font>

175
00:21:39,290 --> 00:21:43,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">hitokira no nukumori to</font></font></font></font>

176
00:21:45,000 --> 00:21:50,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">and this distant yearning for you</font></font></font></font>

177
00:21:45,050 --> 00:21:50,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">haruka kanata no akogare to</font></font></font></font>

178
00:21:50,470 --> 00:21:53,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">I live,</font></font></font></font>

179
00:21:50,510 --> 00:21:53,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">tada sore dake wo</font></font></font></font>

180
00:21:53,300 --> 00:21:59,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">simply repeating this cycle</font></font></font></font>

181
00:21:53,350 --> 00:21:59,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">kurikaeshi boku wa ikite iru</font></font></font></font>

182
00:22:01,440 --> 00:22:08,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">held in my two hands</font></font></font></font>

183
00:22:01,480 --> 00:22:08,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">kono ryoute ni kakaete iru mono</font></font></font></font>

184
00:22:08,320 --> 00:22:10,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">a droplet of time</font></font></font></font>

185
00:22:08,360 --> 00:22:10,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">toki no shizuku</font></font></font></font>

186
00:22:12,360 --> 00:22:18,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">softly clutching forgotten memories</font></font></font></font>

187
00:22:12,410 --> 00:22:18,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">sotto nigirishimete wasureta kioku</font></font></font></font>

188
00:22:18,700 --> 00:22:21,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">lost words</font></font></font></font>

189
00:22:18,750 --> 00:22:21,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">nakushita kotoba</font></font></font></font>

190
00:22:30,470 --> 00:22:34,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">I'll keep these thoughts...</font></font></font></font>

191
00:22:30,510 --> 00:22:34,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">kono omoi wa</font></font></font></font>

192
00:22:37,750 --> 00:22:42,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I'm sorry.
I'm really sorry Sakura-chan.</font>

193
00:22:43,040 --> 00:22:48,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I made a once in a lifetime promise
that I would bring Sasuke back.</font>

194
00:22:49,510 --> 00:22:52,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">But I'm not finished yet!</font>

195
00:22:52,350 --> 00:22:54,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I'll fulfill my promise
no matter what!</font>

196
00:22:54,470 --> 00:22:56,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Since that was what
I was always saying...</font>

197
00:22:56,600 --> 00:22:58,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">that I won't go back on my word.</font>

198
00:22:58,350 --> 00:23:01,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">That's my Ninja Way!</font>

199
00:23:02,020 --> 00:23:04,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next episode:
"The Promise That Couldn't Be Kept."</font>

